OL,3,GNEWSAGirl, 9, suffers broken leg in
OL,4,Ahit-and-run
OL,5,
OL,6,FA nine-year-old girl had her leg broken
OL,7,Fwhen she was hit by a car that then
OL,8,Fdrove off.
OL,10,FLancashire Police said the child was
OL,11,Fhit by a car on White Lund Road,
OL,12,FMorecambe, at 20:30 GMT on Saturday.
OL,14,FPolice said that "while the driver
OL,15,Finitially stopped at the scene and
OL,16,Fspoke with people", he left before the
OL,17,Femergency services arrived.
OL,23,APub: 01-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
